 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Not at all. Many adults learn languages successfully in their teenage years, sometimes much later. Lots of people learn with an accent. It' more about sounding confident and making yourself understood. Portuguese is lovely, and Greece would be a great trip. Greek is still quite different though, so you' need time. There are lots of good apps and online courses. Babe website has reviews if you want digital, and language schools often offer free tutors for adults.",
